1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,600
Refund requests: read the message, check the order, decide, refund - twenty times a day.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,800
RefundGPT. Paste the conversation and the PayPal Capture ID.

3
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:25,000
The AI extracts the order, amount, claims and evidence, matches your refund policy,

4
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:33,500
and recommends an action with a confidence score - plus the reasoning, so you can disagree.

5
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:56,500
You stay the decision maker. Approve, change the amount, or reject.

6
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:19,500
Before money moves, it verifies the PayPal capture and checks the amount against it.

7
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:27,500
Then it refunds through the PayPal Refund API with an idempotency key - no double refunds.

8
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:59,000
That is a real sandbox refund, executed live - Refund ID visible in the receipt.

9
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:12,000
Every case lands in an AG Grid operations view, backed by an audit trail.

10
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:16,200
RefundGPT - the AI does the reading and the PayPal call. You keep the judgment.

